  "system": {
    "description": "<p>Although you might not wear furs and carry a spiked stick, you're often mistaken for a Barbarian. Unlike those rage-filled Barbarians, though, Pit Fighters are much more cunning and adept at survival, especially in close-quarters combat. You'll use anything at your disposal to defeat your opponent, including the pit itself.</p><ul><li>+3 Dexterity</li><li>+2 Intelligence</li><li>+1 Strength</li><li>+3 Attack of Opportunity and Dirty Fighting Skills</li><li>+2 Dodge and Improvised Weapons Skills</li><li>+2 DR Buff</li><li>Silver Earth Box, with guaranteed Earth Hobby Potion</li></ul>",
